        32("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Emulators Management View</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Browses buckets, compatible<br />releases, and installed<br />versions. Presents refresh,<br />install, update, rollback,<br />and remove actions and their<br />outcomes.</div>")
        style 32 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        33("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Emulator Bundle Manager</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET, Git, JSON, SHA-256]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Reads Git bucket manifests at<br />a recorded commit, selects a<br />compatible host target,<br />verifies release archives,<br />and installs immutable<br />bundles with receipts and<br />validated optional debugger<br />profile assets.</div>")
